{
  "_schema_version": "1.0",
  "run_id": "UNINITIALIZED",
  "_artifact_contract": {
    "required_fields": [
      "path",
      "stage",
      "owner",
      "status",
      "sha256",
      "inputs"
    ],
    "stage_values": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6],
    "owner_values": ["claude", "codex"],
    "status_values": [
      "draft",
      "verified",
      "needs_revision",
      "stale",
      "final"
    ],
    "unusable_for_delivery": ["needs_revision", "stale"],
    "notes": [
      "path 为工作区相对路径，不得重复登记，不得逃出工作区。",
      "sha256 形如 sha256:<64 位十六进制>，必须与文件当前内容一致。",
      "inputs 是该产物依赖的工作区相对路径数组，可为空。",
      "paper.md 在 Stage 6 完成前必须以 status=final 登记。"
    ]
  },
  "artifacts": []
}
